{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-ed70b2", "type": "material"}, "note": "力は被る者も振るう者も物に変えるという定義を、戦争を出来事ではなく作用として読む起点に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-726c39", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-8c098a", "type": "material"}, "note": "戦わずして屈するという、血を流さない力の行使を、戦争の反対側ではなく戦争の文法の内部に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-3a4fec", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-4d69fe", "type": "material"}, "note": "量が増えると判定の語が罪から義へ反転するという故障を、数える書庫への警告として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a880b5", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-c45078", "type": "material"}, "note": "命令が届く前に無効になる霧を、責任の所在が霞む最も古い小説的記述として機械の戦争へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-ecf0b6", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-022b4c", "type": "material"}, "note": "報告文「異状なし」と死の同日性を、記録の文体が出来事を消す仕組みとして置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-c455dd", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-21f615", "type": "material"}, "note": "記録の精度が反省を保証しない反例として、レマルクと対をなす。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-cf6530", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-735098", "type": "material"}, "note": "嘘を教材として流通する回路は、教室から前線へ届くという告発を置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a73fbf", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-fc0fe4", "type": "material"}, "note": "判別できない信号と飢えた目を、標的判別の議論への安易な接続を避けながら置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-958021", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-179f13", "type": "material"}, "note": "死の列挙が反復によって均されていく構造を、台帳の列挙への自戒として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-37c529", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-7a19cd", "type": "material"}, "note": "問いへの返信が処方箋にならない往復書簡を、保留のコストとして置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-d357b8", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-8eb221", "type": "material"}, "note": "非暴力を力の差し控えと定義し、書庫の「戦争なし」を徳へ変換することを禁じる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a35e26", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-7a962b", "type": "material"}, "note": "沈黙を加担の一形態として定義し、不在の実測の中立性への自戒とする。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-4d7932", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-c14aba", "type": "material"}, "note": "権力と暴力を人数と用具で区別し、書庫の条件の薄さを清さと呼ばない根拠にする。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-1c736e", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-91b398", "type": "material"}, "note": "秩序の維持費としての暴力を、場所と境界の議論へ接続する。比喩としての流用はしない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-546284", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-af2100", "type": "material"}, "note": "敵どうしが似ていくという模倣の記述を、友／敵の区別への内側からの反論として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-b0183e", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-5314aa", "type": "material"}, "note": "殺害が語りの鋳型に流し込まれる過程を、書けることの選別として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a6e7f4", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-10cbc1", "type": "material"}, "note": "傷を約束の不履行の記録として、傷と契りの二つのモチーフのあいだに置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-e89bc8", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-304049", "type": "material"}, "note": "平和を宣言ではなく死者収容という共有作業から始まる手順として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-3c169e", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-451848", "type": "material"}, "note": "トルストイの霧（情報の失敗）に対して、摩擦（実行の失敗）という対を立てる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a20295", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-e8f3a3", "type": "material"}, "note": "敵を感情ではなく殺害可能性のある制度状態として定義し、他者の棚に置き直す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-9877b6", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-82c92b", "type": "material"}, "note": "Gewalt の訳語問題を翻訳のモチーフへ接続し、用語の統一を断わる根拠にする。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-18a3a0", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-971632", "type": "material"}, "note": "二つの法廷という座席表を、自律兵器の責任論への橋として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a04cc6", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-79368b", "type": "material"}, "note": "禁止と例外と処理手続きを一体として、平和を宣言ではなく制度として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-c96565", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-a26aac", "type": "material"}, "note": "敵の欄から身体の出来事で外れる手続きを、友／敵の固定への反論として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-3c4b9f", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-f4c51a", "type": "material"}, "note": "未来の自分を縛る放棄の文を、約束としての記録の最大級の事例として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-97904f", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-255a6e", "type": "material"}, "note": "威嚇という状態を禁止の対象にする文を、孫子の「戦わずして屈する」の対に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-46cf89", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-931a34", "type": "material"}, "note": "命が数えられる枠組みの問題を、収蔵という登録作業の偏りへの自戒として置く。重さの同一視はしない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-45131a", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-da870d", "type": "material"}, "note": "画像を扱わない文字の書庫の盲点を負債として明記し、自己訂正の形式を訂正の束へ送る。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-6e15d5", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-c53e55", "type": "material"}, "note": "不在の宣言が実測の形をとるときの危険を、今セッションの監査記述への制動として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-d342f8", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-9d74ae", "type": "material"}, "note": "不揃いな声の並置という編集形式を、声の帰属と顔の主題へ接続する。証言の引用はしない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-e575ed", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-ef6ea8", "type": "material"}, "note": "記録の複製が身の証しとして人の扱いを変える構造を、分類と人の扱いの問いへ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-8fd500", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-75d52e", "type": "material"}, "note": "土地と身体の回復の速度差を、場所と時間のモチーフへ接続する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-73cffd", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-2c447a", "type": "material"}, "note": "出来事の真実と物語の真実の区別を、検証の手続きの届かない領域として併置する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-459150", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-bc4622", "type": "material"}, "note": "順序を失った原稿の形式を、台帳の整序への自戒として併置する。比喩以上の請求はしない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-cbddff", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-5591d6", "type": "material"}, "note": "名の欠落による代表制を、氏名の総数え上げの対極として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-fe8156", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-53350d", "type": "material"}, "note": "平和の語が脅しの呼び名になることと、損を勘定に載せない復興の技法を併置する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-24a272", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-37d0f1", "type": "material"}, "note": "知覚の装置と照準の系譜の同居を、読む技術の系譜への照明として置く。同一視はしない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-7a1bea", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-051602", "type": "material"}, "note": "殺害可能性の非対称が敵の概念を獲物の概念へ組み替えることを、距離の軸として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-ff2c3d", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-49dfdb", "type": "material"}, "note": "責任を負える者の欠落を、機械の能力ではなく裁きの座席表の欠落として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-eaea51", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-59ce1e", "type": "material"}, "note": "法文に暗黙に書かれた人の判断を、省略された主語の読みとして置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-9a8613", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-677a56", "type": "material"}, "note": "研究者側の集団署名という行為を、作る側が線を書く記録として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-3b5598", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-1829aa", "type": "material"}, "note": "発射より手前の分類の労働を、『黒い雨』の身の証しの分類と逆向きの対にして置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-e4b644", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-5429d0", "type": "material"}, "note": "人の判断を設計条件に置く文を、禁止・責任保持との強さの序列の中で位置づける。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-da0579", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-edec7a", "type": "material"}, "note": "説明責任は機械へ移転できないという一文を、続きを書く仕事の責任文法へ返す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-5aef73", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-6c2fb6", "type": "material"}, "note": "予測不可能性を使用資格の喪失として定義し、束の結論部の形を定める。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-01b351", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261025-war", "type": "material"}, "note": "地の文に戦争語が無いことと、「殺」が黙殺としてだけ残る自己言及を、主題選択の根拠として置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-d2041d", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-ed70b2", "type": "material"}, "note": "既存の『イリアス』第1歌・第24歌を、怒りと涙の叙事ではなく力の作用として読み直す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-d76faa", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-3bdc7c", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-022b4c", "type": "material"}, "note": "同じ西部戦線から、一方は世代の喪失として、他方は没入の記録として書く。対にしてどちらも残す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-5ec219", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-21f615", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-735098", "type": "material"}, "note": "教室から前線へ送る言葉への反論として、「君死にたまふことなかれ」と室を分けて響き合う。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-aeef12", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-414", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-c45078", "type": "material"}, "note": "霧（情報の失敗）と摩擦（実行の失敗）。計画が通らない理由の二つの名。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-66be19", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-451848", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-8c098a", "type": "material"}, "note": "戦わずして屈する仕組みと、威嚇という状態自体を禁じる文。血を流さない力の行使をめぐる正反対の置き方。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-e1aaf2", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-255a6e", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-e8f3a3", "type": "material"}, "note": "敵は実存的に他なる公敵か、近づきすぎた双子のライバルか。敵の定義を一つに決めないための対。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-46c90c", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-af2100", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-79368b", "type": "material"}, "note": "グロティウス以来の戦争の法の系譜を、武力禁止と例外の設計へ接続する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-99f874", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-968771", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-f4c51a", "type": "material"}, "note": "カントの永久平和の歓待権に対し、放棄を自己拘束として書いた文を対に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-45ff1b", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-fbc462", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-ef6ea8", "type": "material"}, "note": "事件当日の光景（原民喜）に対し、その後の生活における記録の写しを書く。広島の二つの時間を分ける。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-d40ab9", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-415aec", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-5591d6", "type": "material"}, "note": "名の欠落による代表（無名戦士）と、全氏名の朗読による総覧（ベトナム慰霊碑）。弔いの二つの数え方。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-d76e89", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-RES-20261024-71138a", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-49dfdb", "type": "material"}, "note": "学習機械一般の責任の空白を、兵器の責任の席の問題へ絞って継ぐ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-b51825", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-e912b1", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-10cbc1", "type": "material"}, "note": "臨床の『イーリアス』共読と、力の詩としての『イーリアス』。叙事詩を傷の傍らに置く二つの読み方。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-d536ea", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-ed70b2", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-2c447a", "type": "material"}, "note": "同じ戦争を、アメリカの兵士とベトナムの兵士の側から書く。どちらも順序と真実の形に傷を負う。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-01d99c", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-bc4622", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-da870d", "type": "material"}, "note": "見る者の位置の倫理と、見る装置の軍事史。画像の問題の両端を文字の書庫の盲点として挟む。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-cde941", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-37d0f1", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-ef6ea8", "type": "material"}, "note": "人を分類の外へ逃がすための写しと、映像を分類して警戒の列を作る工程。分類の向きの正反対。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-4e99f6", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-1829aa", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-7a962b", "type": "material"}, "note": "差し控えとしての非暴力と、沈黙の破棄。平和の行動の二つの形を、書庫の不在の徳化への制動として併置する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-06b88f", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-8eb221", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-9d74ae", "type": "material"}, "note": "「女の顔」を題に持つ証言集を、顔と声の主題へ接続する。証言の引用による照明は行わない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-119ab6", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261024-fe5ec9", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}, "note": "他者の棚に、敵という座と、その座から外す手続き（戦闘外）を新設して組み替える。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-ce88a8", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-005", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MOTIF-20261025-72a83f", "type": "motif"}, "note": "死と弔いの棚に、組織的な殺害とその数え方（名の総覧と欠落）を持ち込み、穏やかな喪の叙述を一度止める。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a2c7f5", "relation_type": "interrupts", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-022", "type": "motif"}}
