{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-766db3", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "敵の欄の不在を、数える係の情景として書く。平和という名づけを保留したまま。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-a02618", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261025-c86e99", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-434e8c", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "平和を状態ではなく手順として書く試み。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-27de11", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261025-b0a147", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-434e8c", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "説明責任の主語を、編集者と手続きの側に置く覚え書き。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-fea0b1", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261025-050954", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-6c2fb6", "type": "material"}, "note": "人を標的として使用する兵器の禁止を求める立場が、敵の欄のない分類の制度を、照準の側から問い直す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-f4a563", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-766db3", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "Q-20261025-636287", "type": "question"}, "note": "平和の語の使用を制動する覚え書きが、手順の束という新しい定式として同じ圧着を繰り返さないかを問い直す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-8ed395", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-434e8c", "type": "fragment"}}
